No changes. Checked:
(a) every solver job (solve) and split job (march) uses its own tempfile.mkdtemp directory under WORK;
    cake_lpr runs on the files in the solver job's directory.
(b) finalize() writes leaves.icnf and open.icnf with tempfile.mkstemp in the output dir, then os.replace.
(c) the first leaves.jsonl record is {"case": --name, "case_sha256": sha256 of the case CNF}.
Also: a leaf goes to leaves.icnf only if cake_lpr printed exactly "s VERIFIED UNSAT" (AUDIT BUG-1);
other verdicts are recorded as UNSAT_UNCHECKED and stay open.
